Content-Disposition: form-data; name="explanation"

The source proof constructs a concrete row: use the first of the positive number of row labels and the zero multi-index.  Positivity of the fixed weights, base height, and interpolation parameters verifies the strict weighted-simplex inequality, so the finite row type has positive cardinality.
